# ============================================================================
# Foundry vendored dependencies (exception to the Python `lib/` rule above)
# lib/ and onchain/lib/ hold pinned, committed Foundry dependencies
# (see lib/VENDORED.md). Without these negations they would not be tracked.
# ============================================================================
!/lib/
!/lib/**
!/onchain/lib/
!/onchain/lib/**
